      "settlementKey": "marrowynd:Kharrowport",
      "description": "Isabel Cruzgear is a Gnome inventor whose genius curdled under isolation, grief, and the belief that a perfect machine could solve what people were too frightened to face. In Kharrowport’s transit works, she builds rescue devices, defensive constructs, and sealed mechanisms for the Regent Lattice while quietly fearing that every invention is one bad instruction away from atrocity. Isabel is not malicious, but she is proof that good intentions become monstrous when no one is allowed to question the blueprint.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Kharrowport is a Town in Marrowynd, under Representative Democracy, with moderate danger, Beach and grass with water, Marshes and swamps, Partial forest terrain. Local records favor Altruistic, Neutral, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Elf — Wood Elf, Elf — Eladrin, Fey-Folk — Faerie. Gnome reads through the Deep Gnome entry of the race compendium, within Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, marked by Marduthor. Deep gnomes, or svirfneblin, are adapted to life in the deep subterranean world. They are cautious, stealthy, and highly resourceful in dangerous underground environments. Table cues: Gnome, Darkvision, Gift of the Svirfneblin, Gnomish Magic Resistance; starting tendency Neutral - Lawful - Neutral - Honorable.",
      "rumors": [
        "Isabel Cruzgear knows why an ichor ledger changed hands last Nebday.",
        "Isabel Cruzgear has a contact in Yi’vanyr who will deny everything."
